# 2K Task 2 fixture: PLANTED, proves the built-in ignore layer needs no
# pattern in `.sextantignore` to exclude it. `.env` sits at the repo root,
# outside every resource/schema root the analyze walks reach, so this file
# is never read by any Sextant pass either way — what this file exists to
# pin is `IgnoreRules.load(FIXTURE).matches(...)` on a real repository root
# that DOES carry its own `.sextantignore`, confirming `BUILTIN_PATTERNS`
# still catches `.env` with no `.env` line anywhere in that file.
